    <briefdescription>
<para>Console-based implementation of the <ref refid="class_view" kindref="compound">View</ref> interface. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Allows interaction with the user via standard input/output to select run modes, input/output paths, and whether to display simulation output. Executes simulations using the associated model and prints logs. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
